# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Piper voice models. tool/make_speech.py needs one to render the commentary and
# keeps it in ~/.local/share/piper-voices, but --voices-dir can point anywhere,
# and 63MB of model is build-time input, not a shipped asset. The rendered Ogg
# files under assets/sounds/speech/ are what the app carries.
*.onnx
*.onnx.json
*.onnx.part
